  "translation": "Na yupela i tok: Ol man bilong lukautim ol animal bilong yumi — bulmakau na sipsip — ⟨em⟩ ⟨i⟩ ol wokman bilong yu, stat long taim bilong pikinini bilong yumi i go inap long taim nau, yumi yet na ol papa bilong yumi tu. Olsem na yupela i ken stap long graun bilong Gosen, long wanem olgeta man i lukautim ol sipsip na meme, ol man bilong Mitsrayim i nogut bel long ol.",
